{"id":"rezko","lemma":"резко","pos":"adv","rank":2515,"glosses":["sharply, harshly, abruptly","bluntly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он ответил мне резко.","en":"He gave me a curt answer.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to answer, to reply","l":"ответить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Их поведение резко изменилось.","en":"Their behavior changed drastically.","words":[{"g":"them / their"},{"g":"conduct, behaviour"},null,{"g":"to change","l":"измениться"}]},{"text":"Машина резко повернула.","en":"The car turned abruptly.","words":[{"g":"car, motor vehicle"},null,{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"}]},{"text":"Я резко затормозила.","en":"I braked hard.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]},{"text":"Том резко выдохнул.","en":"Tom exhaled sharply.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null]}]}